cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this project's calibration workflow, please cite this repository and the original NIST study and dataset."
type: software
title: "Min-Max Mass Spectral Probability Calibration"
authors:
  - family-names: Sorour
    given-names: Amirhossein
abstract: >-
  MSc practicum project at Trent University comparing logistic, isotonic and
  expanded logistic mappings from replicate-based Identity Match Factor min-max
  summaries to dataset-conditional same-compound probabilities. Includes a
  documented small input example, research notebooks and aggregate full-study
  results. The full dataset is not distributed.
keywords:
  - mass spectrometry
  - probability calibration
  - min-max test
  - isotonic regression
  - logistic regression
  - imbalanced classification
